# CCAB — Caption Converter & Burner

Match caption files in `Captions/` to videos of the same filename in `Video/`, convert `.sbv` / `.vtt` captions to `.srt`, and burn styled captions into `Output/`.

## Installation

Run the installer script (automatically installs `ffmpeg`, `Pillow` on non-macOS, and registers the `ccab` CLI globally):

```sh
./install.sh
```

Or install manually with `uv`:

```sh
uv tool install --editable .
ccab --install-deps
```

## Quick Start

### Drag-and-Drop GUI

Launch the local studio interface to drag and drop a video and subtitle file into designated cards, tweak colors/backgrounds with an instant live preview, and convert + burn in one click:

```sh
ccab --gui
# or
ccab-gui
```

### CLI Batch Mode

Place matching files in `Video/` and `Captions/` (e.g. `Video/test.mp4` and `Captions/test.sbv`), then run:

```sh
ccab
```

Preview a single frame at 5 seconds before encoding the whole video:

```sh
ccab --preset yellow --preview 5.0
```

## Styling & Background Presets

List all presets with `ccab --list-presets`:

| Preset | Description |
| --- | --- |
| `pill` *(default)* | White text inside a semi-transparent rounded dark pill |
| `box` | White text inside a sharp-cornered dark box |
| `bar` | White text on a full-width semi-transparent banner bar |
| `outline` | White text with a thick black outline and drop shadow (no background) |
| `yellow` | Classic yellow subtitle text with a black outline (no background) |
| `minimal` | Clean white text with drop shadow only |

## Custom Look Examples

Top full-width dark slate banner:

```sh
ccab --bg-style full-bar --bg-color "#0F172A" --bg-opacity 0.85 --text-color "#F8FAFC" --position top
```

Bold uppercase outlined text:

```sh
ccab --bg-style none --text-color "#FFFFFF" --stroke-color "#000000" --stroke-width 5 --font-weight bold --uppercase
```

Custom pill color, corner radius, and padding:

```sh
ccab --bg-style pill --bg-color "#1E293B" --bg-opacity 0.8 --bg-radius 16 --pad-x 28 --pad-y 14
```

## CLI Options

| Flag | Description |
| --- | --- |
| `--video-dir`, `--captions-dir`, `--output-dir` | Input/output directories (defaults: `Video`, `Captions`, `Output`) |
| `--video`, `--captions`, `--output` | Single-file mode paths |
| `--force-convert` | Re-convert `.sbv`/`.vtt` to `.srt` even if `.srt` exists |
| `--preview SECONDS` | Render a single preview PNG at `SECONDS` instead of encoding |
| `--dry-run` | Show matched files and resolved style without encoding |
| `--preset` | `pill`, `box`, `bar`, `outline`, `yellow`, `minimal` |
| `--font`, `--font-size`, `--font-weight` | Font family (`system` or installed name), px size, weight (`regular`..`heavy`) |
| `--text-color`, `--stroke-color`, `--stroke-width` | Text color, outline color, and outline width (px) |
| `--bg-style` | `pill`, `box`, `full-bar`, or `none` |
| `--bg-color`, `--bg-opacity`, `--bg-radius` | Background color, opacity (`0.0`–`1.0`), and pill radius (px) |
| `--pad-x`, `--pad-y` | Horizontal and vertical padding inside background (px) |
| `--shadow` / `--no-shadow` | Toggle drop shadow |
| `--position` | `bottom`, `top`, or `center` |
| `--margin-y`, `--max-width`, `--line-spacing` | Vertical edge margin, max width fraction, line spacing |
| `--uppercase` | Convert caption text to uppercase |
| `--crf`, `--encode-preset` | x264 quality (default `18`) and speed preset (default `medium`) |
| `--install-deps`, `--no-auto-install` | Install/check `ffmpeg` and renderer, or disable auto-install |
